<fieldset class="cyber-effects-controls" data-cyber-controls>
  <legend>月面微光 · 轻量装饰</legend>
  <p class="cyber-effects-intro">保留真正的系统指针，不追踪移动；文字输入区不生成粒子。</p>
  <label><span><b>月牙光标</b><small>仅鼠标设备；文本仍为 I 形光标</small></span><input type="checkbox" data-cyber-toggle="cursor" checked /></label>
  <label><span><b>点击月芒</b><small>鼠标点在阅读区时，月牙与樱瓣短暂浮现</small></span><input type="checkbox" data-cyber-toggle="click" checked /></label>
  <label><span><b>首页星屑</b><small>只有 6 颗微光；其他页面不显示</small></span><input type="checkbox" data-cyber-toggle="stars" checked /></label>
  <p class="cyber-effects-status" data-cyber-status role="status" aria-live="polite">正在读取装饰偏好…</p>
</fieldset>
